      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "qin_lie",
      "speaker_name": "铁山",
      "text": "[crying] [trembling] 这眉眼骨相……像，太像了！你是擎苍那小子的骨肉？你是陆烬少主？",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
