      "act_id": "act2_one_armed_veteran_father_slays_core",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "qin_lie",
      "speaker_name": "铁山",
      "text": "[whispers] [excited] 少主，你爹还活着！两年前，擎苍小子真的打穿界隙找过来了！",
